<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>{{subject}}</title>
<style>
  body { margin:0; padding:0; background:#f4f6f8; }
  .card { background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:32px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#1f2937; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; direction:rtl; text-align:right; }
  .brand { font-size:20px; font-weight:700; color:#2563eb; margin:0 0 20px; }
  .btn { display:inline-block; background:#2563eb; color:#ffffff !important; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 24px; border-radius:8px; font-weight:600; }
  .muted { color:#6b7280; font-size:14px; }
  .footer { color:#9ca3af; font-size:12px; text-align:center; padding:16px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; }
  a { color:#2563eb; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f6f8;" dir="rtl">
  <tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;">
      <tr><td class="card">
        <p class="brand">Vitale</p>
        {{{body}}}
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td class="footer">
        Vitale — الجزائر · رسالة آلية، الرجاء عدم الرد.
      </td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
